WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Dad, what's wrong with your face?

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:06,100
Dad accidentally fell down while cooking and hit his face.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,700
Wow, it turns out that a fall can turn your face so red. Fish wants to see it.

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,900
Dad, can you fall again?

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:11,900
Eat. Let’s talk after eating.

6
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:14,550
By the way, you have to go to my house today

7
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:16,250
I've already told my parents about the fish.

8
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:17,750
They want to sit down with you and have a chat

9
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:19,150
Ah, you told them all

10
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:20,250
so much happened

11
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,850
Why don't you go and explain it to them?

12
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:24,610
Okay, I'll set off after breakfast later.

13
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:25,710
The fish will come with me

14
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:27,810
The fish won’t go. The fish will stay with its mother.

15
00:00:27,810 --> 00:00:29,010
It won't take much time

16
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:30,410
Dad will take you back in the afternoon

17
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:31,910
Can I buy you something delicious then?

18
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,140
Ah, this won't work

19
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,080
I still have to put my daughter on for such a trivial matter.

20
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:38,880
When did you become so cowardly?

21
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,280
Is he still a man?

22
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:41,380
Who is scared
